{"version":1,"content":"<p>【12:08更新】歐洲地中海地震中心（EMSC）表示，俄羅斯堪察加半島地區周五（16日）發生6.9級地震，震源深度為130公里。</p><p>中國地震台網則測到周五11時35分，俄羅斯堪察加半島附近發生6.9級左右地震（初時公布7.2級，及後修訂為6.9級）。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T04:39:53.594059+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T04:08:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T04:57:39.766578+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T04:37:39.114382+00:00","content_hash":"ae270b1d257dcfc65ad0be6a13d59a66752cd74fb369aa4c8c60d1cc93764563","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}